  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/397/453/campchaird.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">----------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一個小型模組，會在你的遊戲中加入營地椅，你可以將它用作裝飾，或是在營火旁休息。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">----------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/O8nn0sPDmQg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/camp-chair/settings/twitter.com/dmitrylovin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/314/29/twitter.png\"></a></p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>可自由用於模組包及其他內容（影片、直播）</p>",
